From 425faa8d8413bd41fa05ee1d6f9183641df2d889 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "xiu.yang" <xiu.yang@sophgo.com>
Date: Thu, 25 Jun 2026 14:37:51 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(adc): fix small core ADC driver for CV184X SARADC

- Fix CTRL register bit layout: EN=bit[0], START=bit[1], with edge trigger
- Fix channel select to use one-hot encoding via ADC_CHANNEL_SEL_CH macro
- Replace STATUS busy polling with udelay(100) matching Linux behavior
- Add VDD1.8A vref configuration (SARADC_TEST bit[2]) on all controllers
- Move vref/trim into cvi_adc_init to avoid repeated reconfiguration
- Remove unreliable channel conflict detection (shared between cores)
- Remove hardcoded EFUSE clock register write that caused NAND timeout

Change-Id: Ia223782f5a74438b8024552f307a36386433a1f7
